  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protect &amp; Empower Syria&apos;s At-Risk Teen Girls</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Having faced war + trauma, internally displaced Syrian teen girls are at high risk of gender-based violence + child marriage. Project Soar empowers these girls to understand their Value, Voice, Body, Rights + Path using our 25-workshop award-winning teen girl curriculum. With your help, Project Soar will help displaced Syrian girls to speak up, advocate for their rights + set future goals. &quot;A girl without self-confidence is nothing...Project Soar made me a flower blooming...&quot; - Syrian Girls</narrative>
  </description>
